<h1>用 Python 处理 Excel<br>报表的 <span>5 个技巧</span></h1>
<p class="dek">少一点复制粘贴，多一点自动化。<br>从读取数据到交付报表，让你的下一个月报准时下班。</p>
<div class="byline"><div class="avatar">林</div><div class="author"><strong>林序</strong><span>数据与效率工具爱好者</span></div><span class="meta-divider"></span><span>2025.06.18</span><span class="meta-dot">·</span><span class="read-time"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>约 8 分钟</span></div>
</header>
<div class="cover" role="img" aria-label="Python 将 Excel 表格中的原始数据转换为整洁报表的插图">
<div class="cover-grid"></div><div class="cover-label"><span></span> WORK SMARTER, NOT HARDER</div>
<div class="cover-copy"><span class="cover-kicker">从单元格，到可能性。</span><div>Excel, meet<br><em>Python.</em><span class="spark">✳</span></div><p>READ. CLEAN. ANALYZE. REPEAT.</p></div>
<div class="sheet-illustration"><div class="sheet-title"><span class="excel-icon">X</span>monthly_report.xlsx<span class="sheet-dots">•••</span></div><div class="sheet-columns"><span></span><span>A</span><span>B</span><span>C</span></div><div class="sheet-row sheet-head"><span>1</span><span>产品</span><span>销售额</span><span>增长率</span></div><div class="sheet-row"><span>2</span><span>轻量笔记本</span><span>24,800</span><span>↑ 18.6%</span></div><div class="sheet-row"><span>3</span><span>无线键盘</span><span>12,600</span><span>↑ 12.4%</span></div><div class="sheet-row"><span>4</span><span>桌面显示器</span><span class="cell-selected">38,900</span><span>↑ 24.8%</span></div><div class="sheet-row"><span>5</span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
<div class="floating-code"><div><span class="code-prompt">❯</span> <span class="purple-light">import</span> pandas <span class="purple-light">as</span> pd</div><div>df.<span class="green-light">to_excel</span>(<span class="yellow-light">"report.xlsx"</span>)</div><p><span>✓</span> 报表已就绪 <span class="code-duration">0.8s</span></p></div><span class="cover-bottom">LESS MANUAL. MORE MEANINGFUL.</span>
</div>
<div class="intro"><p>每到月底，都要打开十几个 Excel 文件，筛选、求和、调格式，再重复一遍？这些工作，Python 可以帮你接手。</p><p>这篇文章用一份销售明细作为例子，串起 <strong>读取 → 清洗 → 汇总 → 美化 → 批量处理</strong> 的完整流程。每一个技巧都配有代码，你可以从最需要的那一步开始。</p></div>
<div class="setup"><div class="setup-icon">⌘</div><div><strong>开始之前</strong><p>示例使用 Python 3、pandas 和 openpyxl。请在你的 Python 环境中准备好这两个库：</p><code>pip install pandas openpyxl</code><p class="setup-small">示例文件：sales.xlsx · 工作表：销售明细 · 字段：订单号、日期、地区、产品、销售额</p></div></div>
<section class="tip" id="tip-1"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">01</span><div><span class="section-kicker">READ WITH INTENTION</span><h2>精准读取，只取需要的数据</h2></div></div><p>别急着把整张工作表搬进内存。用 <code>sheet_name</code> 指定工作表，用 <code>usecols</code> 选择字段，并在读取时为订单号指定字符串类型，避免丢失前导零。</p>
<div class="code-block"><div class="code-toolbar"><span><i></i>01_read.py</span><button class="copy-button" type="button" aria-label="复制精准读取代码">复制代码 <span>⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd

<span class="comment"># 订单号应在源文件中以文本存储，例如 "00128"</span>
df = pd.<span class="fn">read_excel</span>(
    <span class="str">"sales.xlsx"</span>,
    sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>,
    usecols=[<span class="str">"订单号"</span>, <span class="str">"日期"</span>, <span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"产品"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>],
    dtype={<span class="str">"订单号"</span>: <span class="str">"string"</span>},
    engine=<span class="str">"openpyxl"</span>,
)

<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">head</span>())</code></pre></div>
<div class="takeaway"><span>↳</span><p><strong>一个小细节</strong>　如果 Excel 中的前导零仅来自显示格式，<code>dtype</code> 无法恢复它。已知订单号固定为 5 位时，可再用 <code>.str.zfill(5)</code> 补齐。</p></div></section>
<section class="tip" id="tip-2"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">02</span><div><span class="section-kicker">MAKE DATA RELIABLE</span><h2>先清洗，再开始计算</h2></div></div><p>多余空格、文本金额、重复行，往往是报表数字对不上的原因。先统一格式，再把无效数据单独保存，后面的汇总才有可靠的基础。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-toolbar"><span><i></i>02_clean.py</span><button class="copy-button" type="button" aria-label="复制数据清洗代码">复制代码 <span>⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="comment"># 接续上一步的 df；只删除整行完全相同的记录</span>
df = df.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>().<span class="fn">copy</span>()
<span class="kw">for</span> col <span class="kw">in</span> [<span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"产品"</span>]:
    df[col] = df[col].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"string"</span>).str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()
    df[col] = df[col].<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">""</span>, pd.NA)

amount = df[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"string"</span>).str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">","</span>, <span class="str">""</span>, regex=<span class="kw">False</span>)
df[<span class="str">"销售额"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_numeric</span>(amount, errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)
df[<span class="str">"日期"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_datetime</span>(df[<span class="str">"日期"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)

invalid = df[[<span class="str">"日期"</span>, <span class="str">"地区"</span>, <span class="str">"产品"</span>, <span class="str">"销售额"</span>]].<span class="fn">isna</span>().<span class="fn">any</span>(axis=<span class="num">1</span>)
df.loc[invalid].<span class="fn">to_excel</span>(<span class="str">"待核对.xlsx"</span>, index=<span class="kw">False</span>)
clean = df.loc[~invalid].<span class="fn">copy</span>()</code></pre></div><div class="takeaway"><span>↳</span><p><strong>别急着填 0</strong>　缺失金额不等于零收入。保留异常记录，核对后再补充；日期列应为 Excel 日期或可解析文本，纯数字日期序号需要另外转换。</p></div></section>
<section class="tip" id="tip-3"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">03</span><div><span class="section-kicker">FIND THE BIG PICTURE</span><h2>用透视表，一次完成分类汇总</h2></div></div><p>想知道各地区每类产品卖了多少？<code>pivot_table</code> 就是代码里的数据透视表。只需指定行、列和聚合方式，明细便能变成一目了然的交叉报表。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-toolbar"><span><i></i>03_summarize.py</span><button class="copy-button" type="button" aria-label="复制分类汇总代码">复制代码 <span>⧉</span></button></div><pre><code>summary = clean.<span class="fn">pivot_table</span>(
    index=<span class="str">"地区"</span>,
    columns=<span class="str">"产品"</span>,
    values=<span class="str">"销售额"</span>,
    aggfunc=<span class="str">"sum"</span>,
    fill_value=<span class="num">0</span>,
    margins=<span class="kw">True</span>,
    margins_name=<span class="str">"总计"</span>,
)
summary.<span class="fn">to_excel</span>(<span class="str">"地区销售汇总.xlsx"</span>)</code></pre></div>
<div class="table-caption"><span class="mini-dot"></span>输出示意 <span>单位：元</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>地区</th><th>轻量笔记本</th><th>无线键盘</th><th>总计</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>华东</td><td>24,800</td><td>12,600</td><td>37,400</td></tr><tr><td>华南</td><td>18,200</td><td>8,400</td><td>26,600</td></tr><tr class="total"><td>总计</td><td>43,000</td><td>21,000</td><td>64,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="takeaway"><span>↳</span><p><strong>让口径保持一致</strong>　这里的空组合填 0，表示清洗后的数据中没有对应销售记录。源数据中的无效金额，已在上一步单独隔离。</p></div></section>
<section class="tip" id="tip-4"><div class="section-heading"><span class="number">04</span><div><span class="section-kicker">READY TO SHARE</span><h2>自动美化，让报表开箱即用</h2></div></div><p>数据算对了，交付也要顺手。借助 <code>openpyxl</code> 设置表头、列宽和金额格式，再冻结首行首列，让同事打开文件就能开始阅读。</p><div class="code-block"><div class="code-toolbar"><span><i></i>04_format.py</span><button class="copy-button" type="button" aria-label="复制报表美化代码">复制代码 <span>⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl <span class="kw">import</span> load_workbook
<span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl.styles <span class="kw">import</span> Font, PatternFill
<span class="kw">from</span> openpyxl.utils <span class="kw">import</span> get_column_letter

wb = <span class="fn">load_workbook</span>(<span class="str">"地区销售汇总.xlsx"</span>)
ws = wb.active
ws.freeze_panes = <span class="str">"B2"</span>

<span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> ws[<span class="num">1</span>]:
    cell.font = <span class="fn">Font</span>(bold=<span class="kw">True</span>, color=<span class="str">"FFFFFF"</span>)
    cell.fill = <span class="fn">PatternFill</span>(<span class="str">"solid"</span>, fgColor=<span class="str">"7560C5"</span>)

<span class="kw">for</span> col <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">1</span>, ws.max_column + <span class="num">1</span>):
    ws.column_dimensions[<span class="fn">get_column_letter</span>(col)].width = <span class="num">18</span>
<span class="kw">for</span> row <span class="kw">in</span> ws.<span class="fn">iter_rows</span>(min_row=<span class="num">2</span>, min_col=<span class="num">2</span>):
    <span class="kw">for</span> cell <span class="kw">in</span> row:
        cell.number_format = <span class="str">'"'#,##0.00'</span>

wb.<span class=\"fn\">save</span>(<span class=\"str\">\"地区销售汇总_交付版.xlsx\"</span>)</code></pre></div><div class=\"takeaway\"><span>↳</span><p><strong>数值与显示分开</strong>　数字格式只改变显示方式，不会把金额转成文本。这样，接收报表的人依然可以继续计算。</p></div></section>
<section class=\"tip\" id=\"tip-5\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"number\">05</span><div><span class=\"section-kicker\">DO IT ONCE, SCALE IT UP</span><h2>批量合并，把重复工作交给循环</h2></div></div><p>当各区域的文件格式一致，就不用逐个打开。把原始文件放进 <code>data/</code>，统一读取并加上来源文件名，再一次导出；之后可复用前面的清洗和汇总流程。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><span><i></i>05_batch.py</span><button class=\"copy-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制批量处理代码\">复制代码 <span>⧉</span></button></div><pre><code><span class=\"kw\">from</span> pathlib <span class=\"kw\">import</span> Path
<span class=\"kw\">import</span> pandas <span class=\"kw\">as</span> pd

files = <span class=\"fn\">sorted</span>(
    p <span class=\"kw\">for</span> p <span class=\"kw\">in</span> <span class=\"fn\">Path</span>(<span class=\"str\">\"data\"</span>).<span class=\"fn\">glob</span>(<span class=\"str\">\"*.xlsx\"</span>)
    <span class=\"kw\">if not</span> p.name.<span class=\"fn\">startswith</span>(<span class=\"str\">\"~"'$"</span>)
)
<span class="kw">if not</span> files:
    <span class="kw">raise</span> <span class="fn">FileNotFoundError</span>(<span class="str">"data 目录中没有可合并的文件"</span>)

frames = []
<span class="kw">for</span> path <span class="kw">in</span> files:
    part = pd.<span class="fn">read_excel</span>(
        path, sheet_name=<span class="str">"销售明细"</span>, dtype={<span class="str">"订单号"</span>: <span class="str">"string"</span>}
    )
    part[<span class="str">"来源文件"</span>] = path.name
    frames.<span class="fn">append</span>(part)

merged = pd.<span class="fn">concat</span>(frames, ignore_index=<span class="kw">True</span>)
<span class="comment"># 输出到原始文件目录之外，避免下次重复合并</span>
<span class="kw">with</span> pd.<span class="fn">ExcelWriter</span>(<span class="str">"合并报表.xlsx"</span>, engine=<span class="str">"openpyxl"</span>) <span class="kw">as</span> writer:
    merged.<span class="fn">to_excel</span>(writer, sheet_name=<span class="str">"全部明细"</span>, index=<span class="kw">False</span>)</code></pre></div><div class="takeaway"><span>↳</span><p><strong>保留数据的来处</strong>　“来源文件”列能帮你追溯异常。正式合并前，确认各文件的字段、单位和日期范围一致，并排除 Excel 自动生成的 <code>~$</code> 临时文件。</p></div></section>
<section class="checklist" id="checklist"><span class="section-kicker">YOUR NEXT REPORT, SIMPLIFIED</span><h2>下次做报表，记住这 5 步</h2><div class="checklist-grid"><p><span>✓</span>按需读取，明确字段类型</p><p><span>✓</span>清洗异常，保留核对记录</p><p><span>✓</span>透视汇总，统一统计口径</p><p><span>✓</span>规范格式，让数据易读</p><p><span>✓</span>批量处理，保留来源信息</p></div><p class="closing">把流程写成代码，下一次报表就从“重新做一遍”变成“再运行一次”。</p></section>
